{"sections":[{"slug":"Lorentz协变性","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Lorentz协变性"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">协变性</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Lorentz 协变性”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">协变性是在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lorentz群","text":"Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用下的协变性</span>.</p>\n<p>Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">协变性是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">管定律的定律</span>”.</p>\n<p>Maxwell <span lang=\"zh\">电磁理论天生就有</span> Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">协变性</span>.</p>\n<p>Newton <span lang=\"zh\">运动定律不具有</span> Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">协变性</span>.</p>\n<p>Newton <span lang=\"zh\">万有引力理论与</span> Coulomb <span lang=\"zh\">电磁学具有相似的形式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它们都不是</span> Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">协变的</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}